ForceTorque.description:
6-axis force/torque reading (wrist sensors and the like).

A discovered wrench signal can form a persistent guard condition;
threshold and fresh source/receive evidence belong to the deployment.

GroupKind.description:
What a joint group is for, which decides what it is allowed to do.

ARM groups take IK and cartesian targets (they have a ``tip``);
POINTING (pan/tilt) and LINEAR (lifts, rails) are joint-space only.

PayloadRef.description:
Array metadata: name is a SHM segment or connection-local NET payload ID.

NET preserves exact raw dtype/shape values, including metric float depth;
it does not apply image compression or infer completion of robot commands.

